source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A spaced `\\` pair is a forced newline too; jiro reads a hard break, and the space Jira shows after it becomes leading whitespace on the next JFM line, which a Markdown reader drops.
-- input.jira --
a \\ b
-- rendered.html --
<p>a <br class="atl-forced-newline" /> b</p>
-- want.md --
a \
 b
-- warnings.json --
[]
